Offline Markdown previews bundle markdown-it 15.0.2, an MIT-licensed browser
artifact. Its original license, exact source provenance and bundle hash are
included in static/vendor/markdown-it.LICENSE and
static/vendor/markdown-it.provenance.json. This project retains the upstream
browser bundle without changes.

Python packages are installed separately from the declared dependencies in
pyproject.toml. Their respective license terms apply to those packages. This
source distribution does not include third-party Python environment files,
model weights, user memories, private Skills, media attachments or databases.

Video frame analysis uses an existing FFmpeg executable when available, or the
binary supplied by the separately installed imageio-ffmpeg package. The wrapper
is BSD-2-Clause licensed (https://github.com/imageio/imageio-ffmpeg). FFmpeg's
license depends on that binary's build; consult its bundled license and build
information. This source repository does not redistribute the executable.
